>Welcome to the Freon Tutorial!</SectionComponent>
<p>This step-by-step guide will teach you everything you need to know to build your own domain-specific language (DSL) using <strong>Freon</strong>.<br>
You will learn how to create the supporting tools—such as the editor, validator, and interpreter—that enable your end-users to work efficiently with your DSL.</p>
<p>You can also consult the full documentation, or — if you’re eager to get started locally — <a
